*                                                                               
****** EXCELENS UTFIL                                                           
FILE W5128MD3 PRINTER VB(58   0)                                                
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS 2:A TOM X:TE RAD                                                
UT-IDDC          W   2  A                                                       
UT-KDPRODSL      W   2  A                                                       
